before:
Complete local Java example; the app itself does not execute it:
```java
package study;

public class Main {

  public static void main(String[] args) {
    System.out.println(Main.class.getModule().getName());
  }
}
```

after:
Save each labeled part as a separate file. Main.class describes the Main class; getModule().getName() reads the name of the module containing it.

```java
// File: module-info.java
module study.app {}

// File: study/Main.java
package study;

public class Main {

  public static void main(String[] args) {
    System.out.println(Main.class.getModule().getName());
  }
}
```
